data: {"seq":1568,"event":{"Content":{"parts":[{"text":"[Inbox]\n- from platform-oncall@example.com: {\"kind\":\"degradation.capacity\",\"reason\":\"capacity\",\"namespace\":\"online-boutique\",\"kind_of_object\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"emailservice\",\"uid\":\"0724ef4b-4703-4c54-a785-cf49bb2cb6c1\",\"message\":\"service ready capacity declined 1/1 → 1/2 over 5m20s (ratio 1.00→0.50, drop 0.50 ≥ 0.30, downward steps 2 ≥ 2, window 15m0s); timeline: 1/1 → 1/2 → 1/1 → 1/2\",\"count\":1,\"first_seen\":\"2026-09-13T10:08:17.822677478Z\",\"last_seen\":\"2026-09-13T10:13:38.340837452Z\",\"cluster\":\"std-simian-test\",\"source\":\"sentinel\",\"severity\":\"critical\",\"fingerprint\":\"sha256:6674c759a4fa9202ac4cfd5d7e13066c9c30b67905d5e3a91e8a084cb4247fca\",\"context\":{},\"type\":\"\",\"enrichment\":{\"bundle\":\"enrichment_error stage=resolve error=\\\"--incident object Service/online-boutique/emailservice: unsupported workload kind \\\\\\\"Service\\\\\\\" (want CronJob|DaemonSet|Deployment|Job|Pod|ReplicaSet|StatefulSet)\\\"\\n\"}}\n\nHow to handle the bundle:\n- A new question, request, or topic → answer or do it, directly. This is the common case for a message from a person; the branches below are for messages that relate to work already in flight.\n- Variants of the same ask or signal → treat as ONE; don't re-do work per message.\n- Corroborating detail on something you already handled → acknowledge it and move on; do not re-open the work.\n- Mid-task adjustments → adapt your next step.\n- Separate asks during an active task → capture with `todo`, continue what you were doing.\n- After a completed task (the latest message is a checkpoint summary) → treat the bundle as the next request and respond once.\nSummarizing work you already reported is not a response to a new question. If a message asks you something, answer that question."}],"role":"user"},"CitationMetadata":null,"GroundingMetadata":null,"UsageMetadata":null,"CustomMetadata":null,"LogprobsResult":null,"ModelVersion":"","Partial":false,"TurnComplete":false,"Interrupted":false,"ErrorCode":"","ErrorMessage":"","FinishReason":"","AvgLogprobs":0,"ID":"c54c04c8-7c8f-4930-999a-f8f11560e132","Timestamp":"2026-09-13T10:13:38.836673Z","InvocationID":"e-196ae2fa-beab-4840-acf7-b1db6ec57edd","Branch":"","Author":"user","Actions":{"StateDelta":{},"ArtifactDelta":{},"RequestedToolConfirmations":null,"SkipSummarization":false,"TransferToAgent":"","Escalate":false},"LongRunningToolIDs":null}}

