data: {"seq":1569,"event":{"Content":{"parts":[{"functionCall":{"id":"call_501269","args":{"plan":"# Incident Plan: emailservice capacity degradation in online-boutique\n\n- **Incident**: `degradation.capacity` on Service `emailservice` in namespace `online-boutique` (ready capacity dropped from 1/1 to 1/2).\n- **Environment**:\n  - Project: `example-project`\n  - Location: `us-central1`\n  - Cluster: `std-simian-test`\n- **Hypothesis**: The Deployment / Pods backing the `emailservice` Service in `online-boutique` namespace have failing/unready replicas (e.g. CrashLoopBackOff, OOMKilled, unschedulable pod, or failed health probes) causing ready capacity to drop to 1/2.\n- **Planned Actions**:\n  - Delegate single-cluster read-only diagnosis to the `cluster` specialist subagent with the verbatim alert payload.\n  - Review the diagnostic findings and root cause returned by the specialist.\n  - Synthesize and present the final Issue → Root cause → Recommendation report with proposed fixes."},"name":"record_plan"},"thoughtSignature":""}],"role":"model"},"CitationMetadata":null,"GroundingMetadata":null,"UsageMetadata":{"cacheTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":14576}],"cachedContentTokenCount":14576,"candidatesTokenCount":250,"candidatesTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":250}],"promptTokenCount":15157,"promptTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":15157}],"thoughtsTokenCount":889,"totalTokenCount":16296,"trafficType":"ON_DEMAND"},"CustomMetadata":null,"LogprobsResult":null,"ModelVersion":"","Partial":false,"TurnComplete":false,"Interrupted":false,"ErrorCode":"","ErrorMessage":"","FinishReason":"","AvgLogprobs":0,"ID":"edd7cecb-1bcf-4f8e-ba7f-2e2837c49bf1","Timestamp":"2026-09-13T10:13:45.824779Z","InvocationID":"e-196ae2fa-beab-4840-acf7-b1db6ec57edd","Branch":"","Author":"core_agent","Actions":{"StateDelta":{},"ArtifactDelta":{},"RequestedToolConfirmations":null,"SkipSummarization":false,"TransferToAgent":"","Escalate":false},"LongRunnin