data: {"seq":1611,"event":{"Content":{"parts":[{"text":"### Issue\nThe `emailservice` workload in namespace `online-boutique` on cluster `std-simian-test` experienced a ready capacity drop from 100% (1/1) to 50% (1/2). A rolling update was triggered, but the new replica is repeatedly failing on startup and unable to pass readiness checks.\n\n*(Note: Diagnostic delegation to the specialist subagent encountered an upstream rate limit [Error 429: Resource Exhausted], so diagnosis was performed directly via GKE cluster read APIs.)*\n\n---\n\n### Root Cause\n1. **Memory Resource Starvation (Out of Memory / OOMKilled)**:\n   - The Deployment `emailservice` was recently updated with container memory requests and limits set to **`8Mi`** (reduced from the previous `64Mi` request / `128Mi` limit).\n   - The new pod (`emailservice-757699675c-5x25x`) immediately ran out of memory during initialization, terminated with exit code `137` (`OOMKilled`), and entered `CrashLoopBackOff` [call_386883].\n2. **Stalled Rollout**:\n   - Because the new replica cannot start, the Deployment has 1 available replica on the old ReplicaSet (`emailservice-6d87f8cdf8-qwwsb`) and 1 unready/failing replica on the new ReplicaSet (`emailservice-757699675c`), degrading total ready capacity to 1/2 [call_602284, call_602288].\n\n---\n\n### Recommendation (Proposal)\n\nRestore the container resource requests and limits in Deployment `emailservice` to sufficient operating values (e.g., memory request `64Mi`, limit `128Mi`, CPU request `100m`, limit `200m`).\n\n#### Proposed Manifest Patch\n\n```diff\napiVersion: apps/v1\nkind: Deployment\nmetadata:\n  name: emailservice\n  namespace: online-boutique\nspec:\n  template:\n    spec:\n      containers:\n      - name: server\n        resources:\n          requests:\n-           cpu: 10m\n-           memory: 8Mi\n+           cpu: 100m\n+           memory: 64Mi\n          limits:\n-           cpu: 100m\n-           memory: 8Mi\n+           cpu: 200m\n+           memory: 128Mi\n```"},{"thoughtSignature":""}],"role":"model"},"CitationMetadata":null,"GroundingMetadata":null,"UsageMetadata":{"cacheTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":14576}],"cachedContentTokenCount":14576,"candidatesTokenCount":564,"candidatesTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":564}],"promptTokenCount":23635,"promptTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":23635}],"thoughtsTokenCount":496,"totalTokenCount":24695,"trafficType":"ON_DEMAND"},"CustomMetadata":null,"LogprobsResult":null,"ModelVersion":"","Partial":false,"TurnComplete":false,"Interrupted":false,"ErrorCode":"","ErrorMessage":"","FinishReason":"","AvgLogprobs":0,"ID":"20b5322b-215d-43f8-90a0-1258dde76877","Timestamp":"2026-09-13T10:14:57.751206Z","InvocationID":"e-196ae2fa-beab-4840-acf7-b1db6ec57edd","Branch":"","Author":"core_agent","Actions":{"StateDelta":{},"ArtifactDelta":{},"RequestedToolConfirmations":null,"SkipSummarization":false,"TransferToAgent":"","Escalate":false},"LongRunningToolIDs":null}}

