data: {"seq":1616,"event":{"Content":{"parts":[{"text":"The memory limits on the `server` container in the `emailservice` Deployment:\n\n- **Current memory limit:** `8Mi` (with `8Mi` request)\n- **Previous memory limit:** `128Mi` (with `64Mi` request)\n\n### Evidence / Tool Call Citations\n\n1. **`gke_get_k8s_resource`** (`resourceType: \"deployment\"`, `name: \"emailservice\"`, `namespace: \"online-boutique\"`):\n   - **Current configuration** (`spec.template.spec.containers[0].resources`):\n     ```yaml\n     resources:\n       limits:\n         cpu: 100m\n         memory: 8Mi\n       requests:\n         cpu: 10m\n         memory: 8Mi\n     ```\n   - **Previous configuration** (from `metadata.annotations[\"kubectl.kubernetes.io/last-applied-configuration\"]`):\n     ```json\n     \"resources\": {\n       \"limits\": {\n         \"cpu\": \"200m\",\n         \"memory\": \"128Mi\"\n       },\n       \"requests\": {\n         \"cpu\": \"100m\",\n         \"memory\": \"64Mi\"\n       }\n     }\n     ```\n\n2. **`gke_describe_k8s_resource`** (`resourceType: \"pod\"`, `name: \"emailservice-757699675c-5x25x\"`, `namespace: \"online-boutique\"`):\n   - Confirms the active failing pod is running with `Limits: cpu: 100m, memory: 8Mi`, having terminated with `Reason: OOMKilled` (Exit Code: 137)."},{"thoughtSignature":""}],"role":"model"},"CitationMetadata":null,"GroundingMetadata":null,"UsageMetadata":{"cacheTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":14576}],"cachedContentTokenCount":14576,"candidatesTokenCount":394,"candidatesTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":394}],"promptTokenCount":24927,"promptTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":24927}],"thoughtsTokenCount":320,"totalTokenCount":25641,"trafficType":"ON_DEMAND"},"CustomMetadata":null,"LogprobsResult":null,"ModelVersion":"","Partial":false,"TurnComplete":false,"Interrupted":false,"ErrorCode":"","ErrorMessage":"","FinishReason":"","AvgLogprobs":0,"ID":"f987345c-e1e7-4e59-9f9c-fda503b34683","Tim